| 2021 | 321.1bn | 137.1bn | 9.5% |
| 2022 | 268.3bn | 131.1bn | 9.3% |
| 2023 | 267.7bn | 166.5bn | 10.8% |
| 2024 | 325.2bn | 60.0bn | 3.8% |
